        "html": "<article class=\"source-page-card major-question-card\" id=\"major-question-04\" data-major-question-id=\"major-question-04\"><h2>Ⅳ</h2><p class=\"prose\">屈折率 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"n\" data-display-mode=\"false\">n</span>、厚さ <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"d\" data-display-mode=\"false\">d</span> の薄膜が屈折率 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"n&#x27;\" data-display-mode=\"false\">n&#x27;</span> のガラス面上にある。空気中から波長 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\lambda\" data-display-mode=\"false\">\\lambda</span> の単色光が入射角 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"i\" data-display-mode=\"false\">i</span> で入射する。裏面反射の光①（A→B→D→E→F）と表面反射の光②（A′→E→F）を考える。B、B′で同位相、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\angle DCE=\\angle BB&#x27;E=90^\\circ\" data-display-mode=\"false\">\\angle DCE=\\angle BB&#x27;E=90^\\circ</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"n&#x27;&gt;n&gt;1\" data-display-mode=\"false\">n&#x27;&gt;n&gt;1</span>。</p><figure class=\"past-exam-figure\" data-figure-id=\"q4-thin-film-diagram\"><img src=\"/assets/past-exams/kawasaki-medical-2025-general-regional-quota-physics/figures/q4-thin-film-diagram.svg\" alt=\"屈折率nの薄膜の上に空気、下に屈折率n′のガラス。光①はA B D E F、光②はA′ E Fの順に進む。BB′は入射光に、CEはBDに垂直。厚さd、入射角i、n′&gt;n&gt;1。\" width=\"520\" height=\"616\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"sync\"/><figcaption>2本の光の経路と直角条件。EからFへの光は共通の方向に進む模式図。</figcaption></figure><h3>問1</h3><p class=\"prose\">経路B′→Eと同じ光路長の経路を選びなさい。<span class=\"answer-slot\">ソ</span></p><h3>問2</h3><p class=\"prose\">光①と光②の光路差 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\Delta l\" data-display-mode=\"false\">\\Delta l</span> を求めなさい。<span class=\"answer-slot\">タ</span></p><h3>問3</h3><p class=\"prose\">Dでの光①の反射 <span class=\"answer-slot\">チ</span> と、Eでの光②の反射 <span class=\"answer-slot\">ツ</span> の位相変化を選びなさい。</p><h3>問4</h3><p class=\"prose\">Fで観測する光が最も暗くなる光路差の条件を求めなさい。ただし <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"m=0,1,2,\\ldots\" data-display-mode=\"false\">m=0,1,2,\\ldots</span>。<span class=\"answer-slot\">テ</span></p><div class=\"structured-list structured-list--values\" role=\"list\"><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__text\"><span class=\"answer-slot\">ソ</span>：① B→C　② C→D　③ B→D　④ C→D→E　⑤ B→D→E</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__text\"><span class=\"answer-slot\">タ</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"nd\\sin i\" data-display-mode=\"false\">nd\\sin i</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"nd\\cos i\" data-display-mode=\"false\">nd\\cos i</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"2nd\\sqrt{1-\\sin^2i/n^2}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">2nd\\sqrt{1-\\sin^2i/n^2}</span> など原本の式から選ぶ。</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__text\"><span class=\"answer-slot\">チ</span>・<span class=\"answer-slot\">ツ</span>：① <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\pi\" data-display-mode=\"false\">\\pi</span>ずれる　② <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\pi/2\" data-display-mode=\"false\">\\pi/2</span>ずれる　③ <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"-\\pi\" data-display-mode=\"false\">-\\pi</span>ずれる　④ <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"-\\pi/2\" data-display-mode=\"false\">-\\pi/2</span>ずれる　⑤ 変化なし</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__text\"><span class=\"answer-slot\">テ</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"m,\\lambda\" data-display-mode=\"false\">m,\\lambda</span> を用いた原本の条件式から選ぶ。</div></div></div></article>"
      },
      {
        "id": "major-question-05",
