        ],
        "html": "<article class=\"source-page-card major-question-card\" id=\"major-question-05\" data-major-question-id=\"major-question-05\"><h2>Ⅴ</h2><p class=\"prose\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"^{235}\\mathrm U\" data-display-mode=\"false\">^{235}\\mathrm U</span> の半減期を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"T\" data-display-mode=\"false\">T</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"^{238}\\mathrm U\" data-display-mode=\"false\">^{238}\\mathrm U</span> の半減期を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"6T\" data-display-mode=\"false\">6T</span> とする。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"t=0\" data-display-mode=\"false\">t=0</span> の個数をそれぞれ <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"n,m\" data-display-mode=\"false\">n,m</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"t=-6T\" data-display-mode=\"false\">t=-6T</span> の個数を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"n&#x27;,m&#x27;\" data-display-mode=\"false\">n&#x27;,m&#x27;</span> とする。両時刻における <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"^{238}\\mathrm U\" data-display-mode=\"false\">^{238}\\mathrm U</span> に対する <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"^{235}\\mathrm U\" data-display-mode=\"false\">^{235}\\mathrm U</span> の割合は等しい。</p><h3>問1</h3><p class=\"prose\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"t=3T\" data-display-mode=\"false\">t=3T</span> の <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"^{235}\\mathrm U\" data-display-mode=\"false\">^{235}\\mathrm U</span> は <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"n\" data-display-mode=\"false\">n</span> の何倍か。<span class=\"answer-slot\">ト</span></p><h3>問2</h3><p class=\"prose\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"t=3T\" data-display-mode=\"false\">t=3T</span> の <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"^{238}\\mathrm U\" data-display-mode=\"false\">^{238}\\mathrm U</span> は <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"m\" data-display-mode=\"false\">m</span> の何倍か。<span class=\"answer-slot\">ナ</span></p><h3>問3</h3><p class=\"prose\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"n&#x27;=n\\times\\boxed{\\text{ニ}}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">n&#x27;=n\\times\\boxed{\\text{ニ}}</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"m&#x27;=m\\times\\boxed{\\text{ヌ}}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">m&#x27;=m\\times\\boxed{\\text{ヌ}}</span> と表しなさい。</p><h3>問4</h3><p class=\"prose\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"^{238}\\mathrm U\" data-display-mode=\"false\">^{238}\\mathrm U</span> に対する <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"^{235}\\mathrm U\" data-display-mode=\"false\">^{235}\\mathrm U</span> の割合が <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"4n/m\" data-display-mode=\"false\">4n/m</span> となる時刻 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"t\" data-display-mode=\"false\">t</span> を求めなさい。<span class=\"answer-slot\">ネ</span></p><p class=\"prose\"><span class=\"answer-slot\">ト</span>〜<span class=\"answer-slot\">ヌ</span>は原本の分数・整数選択肢から、<span class=\"answer-slot\">ネ</span>は <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"T\" data-display-mode=\"false\">T</span> の倍数として示された選択肢から選ぶ。</p></article>"
